{"page":20247,"part":1,"text":"○侧势第一\n\n侧不得平其笔，当侧笔就右为之。口诀云：先右揭其腕，次轻蹲其锋。取势紧则乘机顿挫，借势出之。疾则失中，过又成俗。夫侧锋顾右，借势而侧之。从劲轻揭，潜出务于勒也。\n\n问曰：侧不言点而言侧，何也？\n\n论曰：谓笔锋顾右，审其势险而侧之，故右侧也。止言点则不明，顾右无存锋向背坠墨之势。若左顾，右侧则横敌无力，故侧不险则失于钝，钝则芒角隐，而书之神格丧矣。《笔诀》云：侧者，侧下其笔，使墨精暗坠，徐入及揭则棱利矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20247,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"2e5d5441ee168b9d4ac27232e03c7c54579093bab5593ab706c5026e0c9c7885","textSha256":"2e5d5441ee168b9d4ac27232e03c7c54579093bab5593ab706c5026e0c9c7885","fileSha256":"2e5d5441ee168b9d4ac27232e03c7c54579093bab5593ab706c5026e0c9c7885","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20247-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○侧势第一","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"e8a6b74355e40042dc3ed1261555c2ce127ae05ca3339a4d5636d7fb551a4d88","id":"anFFbPatVrohBDV9TbjewW","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":86,"sourceTextSha256":"1411c284350ff25b34caff1b78f76c06eb51b2f83d98d1a282e006e6fd1eb689","id":"ikSwJh2LEcbkU7xNAZn191","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":79},{"start":88,"end":102,"sourceTextSha256":"5718c68b97603fb9a7ee9b80e55413bcec21738d22db1898bd2e593e1e870adf","id":"nZYNAzzs7X13BucpJWHRcE","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":14},{"start":104,"end":209,"sourceTextSha256":"9b5fcf1beecb3014a6fb6de0f26e36bafc2d820195967e3d